{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2895101","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【创作】2016年创作中的感觉","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一继续聊创作中的感觉：不只要会制作，还要懂得如何安排与运用，并通过观察、模仿和实践不断磨炼审美。","date":"2016-04-19","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · センス（後半）","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · センス（後半）","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2895101.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160421162714id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2895101.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ものづくり"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":424,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2895101/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/001-6089b6adee.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1136,840],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一继续聊创作中的感觉：不只要会制作，还要懂得如何安排与运用，并通过观察、模仿和实践不断磨炼审美。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">制作的感觉固然必要\n\n但要在哪里、如何使用？\n\n如何配置？\n\n这样的感觉也很重要\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n关于感觉这件事\n\n再多聊一点！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n用画来举个例子……\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n皮卡丘和花！\n\n假设我们想画这样的画\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/001-6089b6adee.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/001-6089b6adee.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哪种花？当然也很重要……\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n这次的重点\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n花要怎么使用？\n\n这种感觉\n\n很重要\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n花\n\n是让它开在地面上？\n\n还是让它拿在手里？\n\n要怎么拿？\n\n还是做成耳饰？\n\n要怎么戴在耳朵上？\n\n或者试着叼在嘴里？\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n怎么样？\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n意外地很考验感觉吧？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/002-89ad3a6955.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/002-89ad3a6955.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n天生的\n\n感觉或许也有\n\n不过增田认为，感觉是可以磨炼的\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n像用香气锻炼鼻子一样\n\n像通过食物锻炼味觉一样\n\n像分辨声音、锻炼耳朵一样\n\n\n\n像磨炼时尚品味一样\n\n磨炼自己的感觉\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n考虑制作东西所需要的东西\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n仔细观察事物\n\n看看一流的东西\n\n思考一番\n\n试着模仿\n\n试着发挥创意\n\n试着灵活运用\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n感觉\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这是一种非常\n\n不可思议的东西\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这种感觉\n\n为了让它\n\n闪闪发光\n\n每天\n\n都来磨炼它吧！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附带内容）\n\n把已经确定的植物\n\n放在哪里、如何\n配置才是最好的？\n无论做什么工作\n\n这种感觉都能派上用场\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/003-1ef0635109.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/003-1ef0635109.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"702\"></a></figure></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">作るセンスも必要ですが\n\nどこでどのように使うのか？\n\n配置するのか？\n\nというセンスも重要です\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nというセンスの話を\n\nもう少し！\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n絵で例えてみると・・\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nピカチュウと花を描きたい！\n\nとしましょう\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/001-6089b6adee.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/001-6089b6adee.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどの花を描くか？も\nもちろん大切ですが・・\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今回のポイント\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n花をどう使うのか？\n\nこのセンス\n\n重要です\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n花を\n\n地面に咲かせるのか？\n\n持たせるのか？\n\nどう持たせるのか？\n\n耳飾りにするのか？\n\nどう耳に付けるのか？\n\n口にくわえてみる？\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどうでしょう？\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n意外とセンスが試されますよね？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/002-89ad3a6955.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/002-89ad3a6955.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nもって生まれた\n\nセンスもあると思いますが\n\nマスダはセンスは磨けるものと\n\n思っています\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n香りで鼻を鍛えるように\n\n食べ物で味覚を鍛えるように\n\n音を聞き分けて耳を鍛えるように\n\n\n\nファッションセンスを\n磨くのと同じように\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nもの作りに必要なものを考え\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nよくものを見て\n\n一流のものを見て\n\n考えてみる\n\nマネしてみる\n\n発想してみる\n\n応用してみる\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nセンス\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそれはとても\n\n不思議なものです\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそのセンスが\n\nキラキラ輝くように\n\n毎日\n\n磨いていきましょうね！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n\n決まっている植物を\n\nどこにどのように\n配置するのがベストか？\nどんな仕事でも\nこのセンスは役立つと思います\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/003-1ef0635109.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2895101/003-1ef0635109.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"702\"></a></figure></div>"}}